Package: figspec
Title: Check and Export Figures Against Journal Submission Requirements
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Semakula",
           email = "semakuladaniel@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = "MD, MPH, PhD")
Description: Fit plots to a target journal's published figure requirements, or
    check whether they already meet them, without looking those requirements up
    every time. Brings the requirements of many publishers into the R session as
    data, builds 'ggplot2' figures to meet them, and exports at exactly the
    stated size and resolution. Covers width, resolution, file format, type size
    and font, line and point weights, colour mode and colour safety, panel
    labelling and axis rules. Every requirement records the publisher page it was
    taken from and the date it was read; a requirement a publisher does not state
    is reported as unspecified rather than assumed to pass.
